        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-752, Lattice Design Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe lattice work on the Cross-Hatched Cabinet Knob really picks up the highlights of any of the 5 available finishes. This knob would be great in traditional style kitchens, and we can't help but picture it on the door to a wine cabinet. It is available in 1-1/4 inch and 1-1/2 inch diameters.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-752 Cross-Hatched Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-752:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-751:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
